# =================================================================
# Unity 子文件夹项目专用 .gitignore
# 适用于：根目录/projects/YourGame/...
# =================================================================

# --- Unity 自动生成的临时文件夹 (最关键) ---
**/[Ll]ibrary/
**/[Tt]emp/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Bb]uild/
**/[Bb]uilds/
**/[Ll]ogs/
**/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
**/[Uu]nityPackageManager/

# --- IDE/编辑器生成的项目文件 (这些是根据本地环境生成的，不应上传) ---
**/.vs/
**/.gradle/
**/.idea/
**/.consulo/
**/*.csproj
**/*.unityproj
**/*.sln
**/*.suo
**/*.tmp
**/*.user
**/*.userprefs
**/*.pidb
**/*.booproj
**/*.svd
**/*.pdb
**/*.opendb
**/*.IDB
**/*.VC.db
**/cmake-build-*/

# --- 用户特定的设置 ---
**/UserSettings/
**/.Plastic/

# --- 资源导入/构建产生的临时属性 ---
**/ExportedObj/
**/AssetBundles/
**/Assets/AddressableAssetsData/VideoCache/
**/Assets/StreamingAssets/aa/*

# --- 操作系统生成的文件 ---
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini

# --- 编译出来的可执行文件 (建议忽略，大文件建议通过 Release 页面上传) ---
**/*.exe
**/*.apk
**/*.unitypackage
**/*.app
**/*.appx
**/*.ipa

# --- 崩溃报告 ---
**/sysinfo.txt

# --- 如果你使用了某些特定插件 ---
**/Assets/AssetStoreTools*